&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a high-performing sales team within the DACH sales organization, responsible for driving growth within large global enterprises from the Retail &amp;amp; CPG industry. Retail &amp;amp; CPG is one of our strategic industries, where we help global leaders optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will create and cultivate strategic relationships to drive sales cycles from deep discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a selected portfolio of strategic accounts from the Retail &amp;amp; CPG industry headquartered in Germany, generating new business opportunities with existing customers. Navigating complex organizations up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts’ needs and systematically drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage your accounts&lt;/strong&gt; from an&lt;strong&gt; existing customer perspective&lt;/strong&gt;, land-and-expand is the typical model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross line-of-business at C-level and below&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence sales motions &lt;strong&gt;across the entire core enterprise value chain, &lt;/strong&gt;translating core challenges into &lt;strong&gt;compelling, AI-enabled use cases &lt;/strong&gt;that deliver&lt;strong&gt; measurable execution capacity &lt;/strong&gt;against &lt;strong&gt;strategic customer pain points.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an individual revenue target for closing six-seven-figure deals within your accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage closely with partners e.g, consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners…&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;SaaS Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex, strategic business solutions to large enterprise accounts with full account ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;AI / Management Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, driving AI projects with direct responsibility for account management, client relationships, business development / client acquisition and carrying your own net new revenue quota&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of commitment, long tenure, and &lt;strong&gt;successful career progression &lt;/strong&gt;with your previous companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;business acumen &lt;/strong&gt;and a deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;core processes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the entire enterprise value chain in the retail &amp;amp; CPG industry, particularly within the domains of Finance and Supply Chain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;Retail &amp;amp; CPG industry.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to build trusted relationships with senior Business and IT stakeholders and engage effectively at the C-level (CFO, CIO, COO, VP Operations etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit&lt;/strong&gt;, a&lt;strong&gt; hands-on mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;strong discovery&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; sales process leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English, with exceptional communication and presentation skills to engage and excite stakeholders effectively at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-SS6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Senior Director, Head of Market Access, EU West Region and work closely with Medical affairs, Market Access, Commercial locally and globally, to support BridgeBio’s mission of delivering transformative medicines to patients with genetic rare diseases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the value demonstration strategy for our products across the region, and translate it into effective patient access: design each product&#39;s evidence generation plan, drive it through to delivery, and align it with pricing and access strategy, starting in France, then extending to the other countries of the EU West region&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead natural history studies, cohorts, registries, and analyses of medico-administrative databases (SNDS, BNDMR/ BaMaRa, rare disease network registries)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead indirect comparisons in the context of single-arm trials and very small patient populations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop health economic models (cost-effectiveness, budget impact) for France, then for other markets in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design real-world data collection frameworks (PUT-RD / data collection protocols) that can be reused for reassessment and in other countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the scientific publication and communication plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Study management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft specifications, run tenders, and select vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convene and lead external scientific advisory committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure all required approvals (health data access, ethics committees, regulatory compliance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the administrative, contractual, and budgetary aspects of studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate all deliverables (protocols, analysis plans, study reports, publications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value communication and internal expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate study results into actionable clinical and economic arguments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive scientific dissemination (congresses, publications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the internal reference point on epidemiology, health economics, and health data matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a network of research agencies, academics, and institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value and access strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own the value demonstration strategy for each product across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build economic value propositions and value dossiers and ensure their local adaptation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to pricing strategy and preparation for CEPS negotiations (e.g., positive externalities, budget impact)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and build the economic modelling and CEESP dossier (early scientific advice, modelling, CEESP submission, technical exchange, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute the health-economic and RWE content of early access dossiers and submissions to the Transparency Committee, in coordination with the Market Access Director, with progressively increasing ownership of Benelux dossiers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate assessors&#39; objections and build responses ahead of submission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;French rare disease ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build working relationships with rare disease networks, reference and competence centres, patient associations, and learned societies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate collaborations with existing registries and cohorts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documenting the patient journey and disease burden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Function leadership and development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and arbitrate the region&#39;s HEOR and RWE budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure the function (methods, quality standards, vendor panel, review processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and manage future team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the region to global HEOR and Market Access teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The above list of tasks is not exhaustive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a France-based role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within France, a priority country, is expected, as is travel to our international office in Zug, Switzerland, for team alignment and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to other countries in the EU West region may also be required. Local team meetings and the designated office location in France are in the Paris area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW398674 BCX0&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;List-kOVW5V UnorderedList-nqKD7g&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;7–10 years of experience in HEOR, real-world evidence (RWE), or market access within industry, biotech, or specialized consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Direct, hands-on experience completing French market access dossiers, including submissions to the Transparency Committee, early access applications, and CEESP assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of observational studies, medico-administrative databases, health economic modeling, and indirect comparisons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing vendors and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Ability to influence without direct authority and collaborate with global, multidisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;A background in pharmacy, medicine, epidemiology, health economics, or biostatistics, with a master’s or doctoral degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in rare or ultra-rare diseases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced defending a surrogate endpoint or biomarker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of French rare disease networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Belgian, Dutch, or Central and Eastern European systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in biotech or a fast-growing organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expected attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly operate independently, with a strong sense of ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize across multiple geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking and methodological rigor&lt;/li&gt;
